Z||000000||fiero56||08-26-2001||09:49 PM||||I just ran across this pic while rummaging through old pictures. Brought a tear to my eye. I wish I had the time(and $$$$) to put into the car that I did back in high-school(college eats up time and $$$). I bought this car back in Feb '99 my senior year in high-school. This pic must have been taken just days after recipt of it. Car had 142,801 miles at hte time of purchase, and I bought it on Feb 8, 1999. I had the wing off to polish underneath(plus it looks a hell of of lot better w/out the wing). The Sable beside was my daily driver at the time. I took the Formula to school usually at request of friends, few dozen times that year, and always parked in the farthest spot available. Once the Sable was totalled by younger brother, Formula has been daily driver. 179,600 miles today, and it hasn't left me on the side of the road yet. Few more weeks, and it recieves a new engine.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Tof00019#2.jpg">  <P>I wanna see other pics of peoples cars.<P>Editted, because it doesn't have to be Fiero only. Just keep pic sizes maangeable. Gets annoying when I have to scroll horizontally <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 08-26-2001).]||||reg||14
